{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have been selected for an ultra-advanced experiment to evaluate a simulation. Your goal: finish as fast as possible while testing your perseverance, patience, and reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do Up is a minimalist 3D platformer that challenges your parkour skills and pushes you to your limits from start to finish.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Simple, Yet Ruthless</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don\u2019t be fooled by the clean design. The minimalist look hides a relentless challenge\u2014every move is an opportunity to fail. But victory\u2026 it\u2019s within your reach. How many attempts will it take before you break?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617750/extras/0326.gif?t=1743896483\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Ready for the Ultimate Test?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you think you're good at parkour, <i>Do Up</i> will push you even further. Dodge obstacles, break limits, and conquer yourself. The question isn\u2019t <i>if</i> you\u2019ll fail, but <i>when</i>\u2014and what you\u2019ll do next.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3617750?t=1743896483","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3617750?t=1743896483","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617750/88f35873c8030100491e0b3d280f1f65d4624f54/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743896483","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617750/88f35873c8030100491e0b3d280f1f65d4624f54/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743896483","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have been selected for an ultra-advanced experiment to evaluate a simulation. Your goal: finish as fast as possible while testing your perseverance, patience, and reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do Up is a minimalist 3D platformer that challenges your parkour skills and pushes you to your limits from start to finish.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Simple, Yet Ruthless</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don\u2019t be fooled by the clean design. The minimalist look hides a relentless challenge\u2014every move is an opportunity to fail. But victory\u2026 it\u2019s within your reach. How many attempts will it take before you break?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617750/extras/0326.gif?t=1743896483\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Ready for the Ultimate Test?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you think you're good at parkour, <i>Do Up</i> will push you even further. Dodge obstacles, break limits, and conquer yourself. The question isn\u2019t <i>if</i> you\u2019ll fail, but <i>when</i>\u2014and what you\u2019ll do next.</p>","developers":["Questich Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617750/bb0d3e3aaf45a5b86fb33a5952679233a4d1cc49/header.jpg?t=1743896483","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Do Up","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br